# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.
#
# Frontend-specific and backend-specific ignores live in frontend/.gitignore
# and backend/.gitignore respectively. This file only covers patterns that
# apply repo-wide, regardless of which subproject generated them.

# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem

# debug
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
